                    <history>
                        <origin>
                            The date of production can be inferred from the fact that Metropolitan <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS8033Qerellos">Qerǝllos</persName>, who held
                            office from 1929 to 1950, is mentioned in several places (cf. <locus target="#90rb"/> and <locus target="#129vb"/>). 
                            The manuscript also carries a note and an ex libris by <persName role="owner" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS3182ContiRo">Carlo Conti Rossini</persName> 
                            (cf. <ref target="#e1"/> and <ref target="#e2"/>). Therefore, it can be ascertained that the manuscript was written 
                            <origDate notBefore="1929" notAfter="1949">between 1929 and 1949</origDate>.
                        </origin>
                        <provenance>The manuscript was in possession of a church in ‘Arbambà’ in <placeName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LOC5597Sawa">Šawā</placeName>, possibly
                            corresponding to <placeName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LOC1516ArbaAm">Arba Amba</placeName> (see <ref target="#e1"/>). The owner of the manuscript 
                            (<persName role="owner" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS15443WaldaMadh">Walda Madḫǝn</persName>) is named in the manuscript 
                            on <locus target="#11ra"/> et passim.</provenance>
                    </history>
